<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Dobrica Ćosić</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1921">1921</a>–<a href="/years/2014">2014</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a> · Also known as Dobrica Cosic</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Dobrica Ćosić was a Serbian novelist and political figure whose works on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/serbia">Serbia</a>'s wars made him a leading voice of Serbian nationalism. In 1992 he became the first president of the Federal Republic of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yugoslavia">Yugoslavia</a>, formed by Serbia and Montenegro. He clashed with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/slobodan-milosevic">Slobodan Milošević</a> and was removed by the federal parliament in 1993.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/dobrica-cosic.jpg" alt="Dobrica Ćosić" width="320" height="369" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: The original uploader was BoskoM at English Wikipedia. · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%94%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0_%D0%8B%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%9B_(Dobrica_Chosich),_firct_President_of_Federal_Republic_of_Yugoslavia.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>The writer <b>Dobrica Ćosić</b> was its first president.</blockquote><a href="/state/federal-republic-of-yugoslavia">Federal Republic of Yugoslavia</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Velika Drenova, in what is now <a href="/countries/serbia">Serbia</a>. Died in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/belgrade">Belgrade</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/serbia">Serbia</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=43.63,21.13&amp;year=1981" aria-label="Velika Drenova on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="5058 617 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Dobrica Ćosić"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5508 887h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5508 887h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=43.63,21.13&amp;year=1981">What was here in 1981? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
